  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1701.18 “Uniform chart of accounts” means the account titles, descriptions, and numbering classification system expressed in this chapter established by the department in accordance with RSA 21-J:13, IV.\n\nSource. #10214, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13489, eff 11-15-22 (formerly Rev 1701.12) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700)",
